# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .NET (HeadTracker.NET) - the active C#/WPF rewrite
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
.vs/
*.user
TestResults/
publish/
artifacts/

# The "*.sln" rule above targets legacy VS C++ solutions; keep the .NET solution.
!HeadTracker.NET/**/*.sln

# Legacy "*.core" (line 7) and "*.app" (line 28) accidentally match the C# source
# directory names HeadTracker.Core / HeadTracker.App, which would hide ALL app code
# (git skips ignored directories without descending). Re-include the directories so
# git walks into them; bin/obj inside stay ignored by the [Bb]in/ [Oo]bj/ rules above.
!HeadTracker.NET/src/HeadTracker.Core/
!HeadTracker.NET/src/HeadTracker.App/
